{
  "id": "DAN.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "DAN",
  "reference": "Dan 8",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daneeri naayolekwa empaya y'entaama n'emburabuzi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogwa kasatu ogw'okulema kw'omukama Berisaza, nyowe Daneeri nkagaruka nayolekwa ekintu, mmazire kwolekwa kiri eky'okubanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kwolekwa oku, nkarora ahonaaho ndi omu rubuga oruzitirirwe orw'omunsi Susa, orubuga orukuru orw'omwisaza Eramu; nkaba nyemeriire haihi n'ekisaaru Ulaayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu naimukize amaiso, dora empaya y'entaama eyemeriire ha mwegeego gw'ekisaaru: Entaama egi ekaba enyina amahembe abiri; goombi garaihire, baitu erimu, likaba liraihire okukira erindi; eri niryo eryamezire hanyuma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hanyuma narora empaya egi neerumba Bugwaizooba, habukiizi obw'emoso na ha bw'obulyo; hakaba hataroho kisoro na kimu ekyasoboire kugyemerra omumaiso, kandi hataroho muntu arukusobora kugitabuka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nkaba nkyahuniriire, ninyekaguza nti, kandi kinu, nikimanyisa ki haajumbuutuka empaya y'emburabuzi, yaruga Bugwaizooba, niiruka muno, ebigere byayo bitarukuhika haitaka; empaya emburabuzi egi, ekaba enyina ihembe eritali nk'amahembe goona, ligiri ha buso bwayo hagati omumaiso gaayo, ekaba inamu ihembe eritali nk'amahembe agandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaija eroleriire empaya y'entaama eri ey'amahembe abiri, ei nkaba mboine eyemeriire ha musa gw'ekisaaru yagihuruutukira egiinaho ekiniga eky'akabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkagirora niirirra empaya y'entaama, ekiniga kigiri kubi, nukwo kugihuumira, amahembe gaayo abiri; entaama ekaba etarukusobora kwemerra emburabuzi omumaiso emburabuzi nukwo kugiteera hansi ekagirubaatirra; hakaba hataroho muntu n'omu arukusobora kugigijuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyarugiremu, emburabuzi yayenyumiza muno; baitu obu yagenzire neeyeyongera amaani, ihembe lyayo erikooto lyacweka, omu kiikaro kyalyo, haimukamu amahembe ana agatali nk'amahembe aga butoosa, garoleriire habukiizi obw'emiyaga ena ey'iguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ihembe erimu ha mahembe ago ana haarugamu ihembe eritoito, lyanyeeta muno, liroleriire ha bukiizi obw'obulyo, ha bukiizi obwa Burugaizooba, na ha bukiizi obw'ensi eyaraganiziibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 12:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyanyeeta muno, lyasobora n'okuseesira ihe ery'omwiguru, nizo enyunyuuzi zonyini, ezimu hali zo, lyaziteera hansi, lyazirubaatiirra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likenyumirizaaho na mukuru w'ihe eri; yaihwaho ekihongwa eky'okwokya ekya butoosa, lyaseesa ekiikaro kye ekirukwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe lyaheebwa ihembe eri hamu n'ekihongwa eky'okwokya ekya butoosa ekyahongwaga habw'ebibi; amazima gaanagwa; lyakora kyona nkooku lirukwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo arukwera naabaza; arukwera ondi yakagwize ogu ayabalize ati: “Ebintu binu ebi naboine omu kwolekwa ebirukukwata ha kihongwa eky'okwokya ekya butoosa, habibi ebifoora ensi matongo, na ha kuleha ekiikaro ekirukwera n'ihe bikarubaatirirwa, birimara kasumi ki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamugarukamu ati: “Okuhika obwire obu buliira kandi bukakya emirundi enkumi ibiri omu bikumi bisatu; obu nubwo ekiikaro kirigaruka kibe nkooku kyakabaga bwona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyowe Daneeri, obu nkaba nkyatunuliire ebintu ebi nindengaho kubyetegereza, nkarora ekintu ekirukusisana omuntu, kinyemeriire omumaiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 1:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahurra iraka ly'omuntu niriruga hagati y'emisa y'ekisaaru Ulaayi, lyayeta liti: “Gabulyeri, soborra omuntu ogu amakuru g'ebintu” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na uwe nukwo kunyirra haihi nambere nkaba nyemeriire; obu yaizire, natiina muno, nagwa hansi njumaire. Baitu yangambira ati: “Wetegereze, mwana w'omuntu, eky'oyolekerwe, nikimanyisa akasumi k'empero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu akaba nakyambaliza, nagwijagira muno, nkyajumaire hansi; baitu akanyimukya yanyemereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yangambira ati: “Ninyija kukugambira ekiriruga omu kiniga kya Ruhanga habwokuba ekiniga eki, nikikwataho akasumi aka ha mpero akaatairweho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi empaya y'entaama enyakwina amahembe abiri ei waboine amahembe gaayo ago abiri nigamanyisa abakama ababiri owa Meedi na Paasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi empaya y'embuzi, egi neemanyisa omukama owa Bugiriiki ihembe erinyakuli hagati y'amaiso gaayo, eri nirimanyisa omukama ow'okubanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ihembe liri eryacwekere, omu kiikaro kyalyo haakununukamu amahembe agandi ana, eri nirimanyisa amakama ana, ihanga eri nkooku liribaganizibwamu, baitu agataliba n'obusobozi nk'obw'obukama obw'okubanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakama ago obu galiba gali haihi kuhwaho, abantu basiisire muno nkooku barukwenda, haliimukaho omukama ataina mbabazi, arukwetegereza ebirooto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliba w'obusobozi obutagambwa, alihwerekereza muno. Kyona eki araakoraga, araakikoraga kurungi. Alihwerekereza abantu ab'obusobozi, alihwerekereza n'abantu ba Ruhanga bonyini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba ncwangya, kyona araakikoraga kurungi habw'obucwangya bwe. Aliba muntu w'emyehembo, kandi alihwerekereza abantu baingi atarukubahabura; baitu alihendeka, hataroho muntu n'omu amukwasireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyayolekerwe eky'obwire kwira n'okukya ekyagambirwe, ky'amazima; kyona otalikigamba, habwokuba kiritwara omwanya mukooto kitakahikiriire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.26"
            ]
          }
